@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Auth - Change Password

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The user is signed in.

Postcondition:
The password is replaced, all old refresh tokens are
revoked and the user gets a new token pair.
end note
:Open the change-password form;
|System|
:Display the change-password form;
|Customer|
repeat
:Enter the current and the new password;
:Submit the change;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the current password is correct and the new one differs;
backward :Return the password error;
repeat while (The current password is wrong\nor the new one is unchanged?) is (Yes) not (No)
:Save the new password, revoke all refresh tokens and issue a new pair;
|Customer|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
